{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"对象的生象"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"对象的生象"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>将一个范畴中的不可逆态射去除, 仅保留可逆态射, 得到一个"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":", 称为其对象的生象, 又叫<strong>核</strong> (core), <strong>极大子群胚</strong> (maximal subgroupoid).</p>\n"}]}}